# Agent memory

Persistent guardrails for this repository live in **`.cursor/memory.md`** (monorepo root). When the user asks to record learnings, update guardrails, or “add to memory”, edit that file. Application source is under **`boats-web/`**; paths in `memory.md` are relative to `boats-web/` unless noted otherwise.
